        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The employer shall grant an employee a leave of absence, without pay, upon request by such employee for the purpose of caring for an adopted child. Such leave to commence on the date of adoption and the request for such leave must be requested five (5) working days in advance whenever possible.",
