            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Each employee covered under this Contract who is required to attend training seminars, workshops, courses or other functions required by the County of Niagara and/or mandated by Federal and/or State Law and which are held only during the normal work day of the employee shall be allowed sufficient time off without loss of pay or leave credits to attend the required or mandated function(s).",
