        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "When an employee is on leave without pay, sick or vacation credits do not accrue for any month where the employee is not in paid status for one-half of the working days. Sick credits will be adjusted each month accordingly and vacation credits will be adjusted in January of each year. The employee's benefit date and longevity date will be moved forward by the amount of time the employee is off payroll. Time off payroll is not credited toward retirement. Employees carrying health insurance through the County, should contact Risk Management to determine if their insurance will be affected.",
