        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b. A regular employee's work week which includes Saturdays. Sundays and Holidays shall not be covered under Section I (a) of this Article. For those employees the first day off shall be considered as Saturday and the second day off as Sunday. A Saturday, Sunday or Holiday shall be con. dered as a regular work day. A scheduled work day falling on a Holiday shall entitle the emp! yee to a compensatory day to be taken as scheduled by the department head.",
